{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\MoviesCollection\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vendor-shadows-server",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "psr/log 1.1.3, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 15 to 20"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "vendor/ ships 1 package that the server ships itself in a major of Nextcloud 15 to 20. Both copies define the same classes, and the autoloader that is asked first decides which version runs.",
        "  psr/log 1.1.3, in 3rdparty/ of Nextcloud 15 to 20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "template-inline-style",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "templates/content/index.php:14 style= attribute",
        "templates/content/index.php:33 style= attribute",
        "templates/content/index.php:47 style= attribute",
        "templates/navigation/index.php:3 style= attribute"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "4 inline styles in templates/. The default Content Security Policy of the server allows inline style; a response whose policy disallows it drops them. A stylesheet added with OCP\\Util::addStyle() holds in both cases.",
        "  templates/content/index.php:14 style= attribute",
        "  templates/content/index.php:33 style= attribute",
        "  templates/content/index.php:47 style= attribute",
        "  templates/navigation/index.php:3 style= attribute"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/MovieController.php:119 new DateTime()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 1 place. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/MovieController.php:119 new DateTime()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "controller-method-unrouted",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/MovieController.php:30 OCA\\MoviesCollection\\Controller\\MovieController::index()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 public method of a controller is reached by no route.",
        "  lib/Controller/MovieController.php:30 OCA\\MoviesCollection\\Controller\\MovieController::index()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-not-checked",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "ncmake has no checks of MigrationService for Nextcloud 15 to 17; the migrations are not held against them."
      ]
    }
  ],
